          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maye kulabo abathi okubi kuhle lokuhle kubi; owenza ubumnyama kube ukukhanya nokukhanya kube mnyama; obeka okubabayo esikhundleni sobumnandi, nobumnandi esikhundleni sokubabayo!",
