              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akekho oyokhathala noma akhubeke phakathi kwabo; akekho oyokozela noma alale; nebhande lezinkalo zabo aliyikuthukululwa, nebhande lezicathulo zabo aliyikugqashuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
