              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukubhonga kwabo kuyoba njengengonyama, bayobhonga njengamabhongo engonyama; yebo, bayobhonga futhi bathathe impango bahambe nayo ngokuphepha, futhi akekho oyoyisindisa.",
          "type": "text",
